From: EglantinePS5 <noreply@eglantineps5.local>
Subject: [PATCH] Migrate 0434-mesh-04-textured-readback.patch

Source: 0434-mesh-04-textured-readback.patch
Local experimental draft against fully patched core-t33 (T35 includes
0425 mesh-03 and 0426). Generated with OpenAI Codex; no human sign-off.

Preserve ordinary UV interpolation, flatten per-primitive inputs on both
sides of the generated vertex/fragment interface, and carry programmed
PrimitiveId through a collision-free private uint varying. Export mesh
clip distances rather than dropping them. Refuse an exhausted varying
map or unsupported clip-distance count at pipeline compilation.

Only the existing EDEN_NX2_MESH_AS_COMPUTE=1 enables this path; default
off. No additional switch, scratch allocation or native mesh requirement.
Native fragment inputs keep BuiltIn PrimitiveId and PerPrimitiveEXT.

The emitter harness checks textured inputs, interpolation, scratch-loaded
PrimitiveId, clip limits and varying exhaustion. Five modules validate
for Vulkan 1.3. Host pipeline syntax and T22 preparation were checked;
no full console build, guest shader replay or GPU rendering was tested.
Task batching, instances, indirect guest draws and cull outputs remain.

Assisted-by: OpenAI Codex (implementation, review and local checks)

